@startuml
title Conceptual V-model for iterative engineering
skinparam linetype polyline
rectangle "Stakeholder needs and\nacceptance requirements" as Needs
rectangle "System requirements\nand system design" as System
rectangle "Architectural design and\nsubsystem interactions" as Architecture
rectangle "Detailed component design" as Detail
rectangle "Implementation" as Code
rectangle "Unit testing" as Unit
rectangle "Integration testing" as Integration
rectangle "System testing" as SystemTest
rectangle "Acceptance testing" as Acceptance

Needs -down-> System
System -down-> Architecture
Architecture -down-> Detail
Detail -down-> Code
Code -up-> Unit
Unit -up-> Integration
Integration -up-> SystemTest
SystemTest -up-> Acceptance
Needs .right.> Acceptance : acceptance criteria
System .right.> SystemTest : system behavior
Architecture .right.> Integration : interactions
Detail .right.> Unit : component behavior
legend bottom
  Conceptual alignment. Test levels and artifacts may be planned or incomplete.
endlegend
@enduml
